+     *   near the turn: the junction picture: type 13 (intersection), 17 (highway exit), 31
+     *     (U-turn), 43 (ramp), with the side streets, the exit direction in degrees and the
+     *     distance bar (90 at the start, down to 10); the road name above it; the list empty
+     *   a tollgate (178): its icon, with a bar from 500 m
+     *   the arrival: type 3 with every value "none", the destination and name cleared
+     * TMAP sends no junction shape, so each turn gets the shape the car's navigation drew for
+     * the same kind of turn on these drives.
+     */
+    boolean stockStyle;
+    /** the maneuver whose junction picture is showing, and the distance (m) it started at */
+    int jctIndex = -1, jctStart;
